; game.xon -- the classic set: how a game of it is tuned.
;
; A set is every .xon file in its directory, read in name order.  Each
; form is (HEAD . ARGS); the engine asks for the heads it knows and
; takes the first of each.

(set "classic")
(title "The Sunken Vault")

; The goal: its name, its glyph, and the level it lies on.  Once held,
; the stairs up open, and the surface is the win.
(goal "the Sunstone" "*" 20)

; The player at the start: hit points and strength; the dice of a blow
; with bare hands.
(player 12 16)
(unarmed 1 2)

; Food at the start; when hunger is felt; when it weakens.  At zero the
; player faints now and then, and starves soon after.
(hunger 1300 300 150)

; A level: how many rooms, a room's floor (width low and high, height
; low and high), the percent a room is lit at level 1 and what that
; changes a level, how many creatures and items, the chance a thing is
; gold and a pile's size (times the depth).
(rooms 6 9)
(room-size 4 12 6 12)
(lit 95 -4)
(creatures 3 6)
(items 4 8)
(gold 35 5 25)

; Experience for level 2, doubling a level; turns a hit point comes back
; in at level 1; the chance, one in N a turn, a creature wanders in.
(exp 10)
(regen 20)
(wander 60)
